% CBC Modern Canadian Bridges (pilot): ten original classroom pieces, one for each of JK, SK and Grades 1-8, each paired
% with a contemporary Canadian recording heard through CBC Music. AI-assisted originals written for this course and
% released CC0 1.0; the recordings are only named and linked, and remain their owners'.
% Published early from the workshop on 12 November 2026: none has yet been tried with a class or read by the reviewers
% its record names, and each workshop record is kept for further correction. A "% improv:" line is a cue for the Improv
% drawer: a choice the players make live in the bars it names.

