N:Original Grade 3 jazz-pop listening bridge; students sing an ABA streetlight song, improvise a constrained two-bar answer and choose unison, imitation or held-tone texture for the final A.
N:Listen: Laila Biali — "Satellite", official video, https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9R-vLt7gHGs. Listen for how jazz-pop balances a clear song with elastic phrasing, piano conversation, dynamic arcs and room for musicians to answer one another.
N:Laila Biali is a Canadian singer, pianist, composer and broadcaster whose work moves between contemporary jazz and song-based pop writing.
N:Original 3/4 C-major melody and words; no melody, lyric, piano voicing, solo or arrangement from "Satellite" is used.
