N:Original Grade 5 alternative-R&B listening bridge; students sing a 6/8 verse, answer a two-bar question with sound or silence, then choose one of three lower-part roles for the refrain.
N:Listen: Charlotte Day Wilson — "Work" (2016), official video, https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0z-HsbovI4E. Listen for a restrained pocket, close vocal timbre, repeated words and the expressive weight created when accompaniment leaves space.
N:Charlotte Day Wilson is a Toronto singer, songwriter, producer and multi-instrumentalist working across alternative R&B and soul.
N:Original D-minor melody, English words, lower part and i-V accompaniment; no lyric, melody, harmony, bass figure, vocal inflection or arrangement from "Work" is reproduced.
